  <subsection xml:id="cmse381-001-lec22-stepclassification-worksheet-loading-in-the-data">
    <title>Loading in the data</title>
        <p>We're going to use the <xref ref="wages-csv"/> used in the book, so note that many of your plots can be checked by looking at figures in the book.</p>

      <p>
        Load the data into the dataframe <c>df</c>, and run the following commands.
      </p>
    <program language="python">      
      df.head()
